--- !u!114 &1977672412874315002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1977672412874314996}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 76bea0b18045d496087247b176a0ace8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    names:
    - Dog
    - Human
    - Human
    - Human
    - Dog
    - Human
    - Human
    - Human
    - Dog
    - Human
    - Narrator
    sentences:
    - '*Looks out the window at the mushroom cloud in the distance, and whimpers
      softly*'
    - It's a scary sight, isn't it?
    - '*Walks over to the window and looks out, his expression solemn*'
    - I never thought it would come to this. The world was already in such a fragile
      state, and it just took one mistake, one moment of miscommunication, to bring
      us all to the brink of destruction.
    - '*Looks up at the human, listening to his words but not understanding their
      meaning*'
    - It's hard to believe that just a few days ago, everything was so normal. People
      were going about their lives, doing their jobs, spending time with their families.
      And now... now it's all gone.
    - '*Looks down at the dog and strokes his fur*'
    - But we're still here, buddy. You and me. And as long as we're together, we'll
      make it through this.
    - '*Wags his tail and licks the human''s hand, sensing the comfort in his words*'
    - I wish I could explain everything to you, but I know you don't understand.
      All you know is that something bad has happened, and we have to stay inside
      to stay safe. But we'll find a way to make it through, I promise.
    - 'The human sits down next to the dog and begins to pet him, lost in thought
      as he thinks about the world outside and what the future might hold. The dog
      rests his head on the human''s lap, content to be with his human and hopeful
      for what might come next.

'
  itemsClicked: 0
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 0}
  humanButton: {fileID: 0}
